-- Apply with apply_migration name "kafaa_audit2_role_notes_ar_values_p1", any time after part 08 (kafaa_audit2_role_notes_ar_p1 adds the column).
-- Sets kafaa_job_roles.basis_note_ar on the 16 roles that have an English basis_note, to the values a fresh build seeds
-- (kafaa/scripts/seed/ext/zz-audit2-integrity.mjs BASIS_NOTE_AR). Guarded: a row changes only when its English note is still the seeded text
-- and its Arabic note is still empty, so a second run (or an edited role) changes nothing. Touches this one column of kafaa_job_roles only;
